    {
      "text": "my God hath been my support, 2 Ne. 4:20. God supports you from one moment to another, Mosiah 2:21. the Lord doth support me, Mosiah 2:30. Noah3 taxes people for his support, Mosiah 11:3–4. priests are supported in laziness by king’s taxes, Mosiah 11:6. priests should labor with own hands for support, Mosiah 18:24 (27:5). Limhi commands that every man impart to support of widows, Mosiah 21:17. devil will not support his children, Alma 30:60. whosoever puts trust in God shall be supported in trials, Alma 36:3. those who do not covenant to support freedom are put to death, Alma 46:35. Moroni1 prepares to support liberty, Alma 48:10. chief judge appointed with oath to support cause of God, Alma 50:39. pride of king-men to be pulled down, or they should support cause of liberty, Alma 51:17. Nephites support robbers, Hel. 6:38. Riplakish causes people in prison to labor continually for their support, Ether 10:6.",
